I’m sorry—I don’t currently have a way to remove items from the inventory. I can help you locate the clothing items that meet your criteria so you know exactly which ones would qualify for removal:

```json
{
  "search_terms": {
    "keywords": "",
    "category": "clothing",
    "price_range": "50-100",
    "sort_order": "asc",
    "in_stock": true
  }
}
```

If you’d like me to run that query instead, let me know!
